      "text" : "{\"schemaVersion\":\"1.8\",\"facts\":[{\"factId\":\"f1\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s44dc49cda434v1u0012\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0014\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0016\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0018\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0020\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0037\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"SYMPTOM\",\"text\":\"하루 정도 전부터 시작된, 주로 왼쪽의 욱신거리는 심한 두통이 계속 있고 강도가 들쭉날쭉하다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f2\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s44dc49cda434v1u0018\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0022\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0024\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0026\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0039\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0043\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"SYMPTOM\",\"text\":\"두통과 함께 빛에 민감하지만, 시력 문제, 이상한 냄새나 맛, 메스꺼움/구토, 피부 변화, 팔다리의 힘 빠짐·저림·감각 둔화는 없다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f3\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s44dc49cda434v1u0035\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0041\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0048\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0051\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"SYMPTOM\",\"text\":\"감기 같은 증상, 측위로 악화되는 양상, 기침/재채기로 악화되는 양상은 없다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f4\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s44dc49cda434v1u0030\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0088\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"ASSESSMENT\",\"text\":\"이번 두통은 새로 생긴 것으로, 과거에 정기적인 두통 병력은 없다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f5\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s44dc49cda434v1u0063\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"ASSESSMENT\",\"text\":\"어머니에게 고혈압과 편두통 병력이 있다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f6\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s44dc49cda434v1u0055\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0057\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0059\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0061\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"MEDICATION\",\"text\":\"Microgynon 피임약을 약 6년째 복용 중이며, 특별한 부작용은 없다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"CONTINUE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":{\"name\":\"Microgynon\",\"doseText\":null,\"frequencyText\":null,\"courseDurationText\":\"약 6년째\",\"instructions\":\"피임약\",\"startsOn\":null,\"endsOn\":null,\"clockTimes\":[],\"scheduleRecurrence\":null,\"weekdays\":[]},\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f7\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s44dc49cda434v1u0082\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0084\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"MEDICATION\",\"text\":\"두통 때문에 Paracetamol만 복용했으며, Aspirin에는 알레르기/불내성이 있어 복용하지 않았다(먹으면 심한 메스꺼움).\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"HISTORICAL\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":{\"name\":\"Paracetamol\",\"doseText\":null,\"frequencyText\":null,\"courseDurationText\":null,\"instructions\":\"두통 때문에 복용\",\"startsOn\":null,\"endsOn\":null,\"clockTimes\":[],\"scheduleRecurrence\":null,\"weekdays\":[]},\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f8\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s44dc49cda434v1u0086\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0089\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0097\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0107\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"MEDICATION\",\"text\":\"Paracetamol과 함께 소염제를 복용하라고 권고받았고, 이후 Ibuprofen을 먹겠다고 했다.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"NONE\",\"clauses\":[]},\"medicationRole\":\"PRESCRIBED\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":{\"name\":\"Ibuprofen\",\"doseText\":null,\"frequencyText\":null,\"courseDurationText\":null,\"instructions\":\"Paracetamol과 함께 복용; 소염제\",\"startsOn\":null,\"endsOn\":null,\"clockTimes\":[],\"scheduleRecurrence\":null,\"weekdays\":[]},\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f9\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s44dc49cda434v1u0098\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0099\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0106\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"PRECAUTION\",\"text\":\"두통이 가라앉지 않거나 더 심해지거나, 다른 변화가 생기거나, 고열과 함께 몸이 안 좋거나, 계속되거나, 생리 주기와 관련되거나, 특정 유발 요인이 있는 것 같으면 바로 연락하라.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"COMPLEX\",\"clauses\":[\"가라앉지 않거나 더 심해지거나 두통에 다른 변화가 생기면 바로 연락\",\"고열과 함께 몸이 안 좋으면 바로 연락\",\"두통이 계속되면 연락\",\"생리 주기와 관련되면 연락\",\"특정한 것이 두통을 유발하는 것 같으면 연락\",\"열이 나거나 두통이 계속 더 심해지거나 발진이 생기면 바로 연락\"]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"NONE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":null,\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]},{\"factId\":\"f10\",\"support\":{\"statementIds\":[\"s44dc49cda434v1u0102\",\"s44dc49cda434v1u0103\"],\"questionIds\":[],\"answerIds\":[],\"correctionIds\":[]},\"kind\":\"FOLLOW_UP\",\"text\":\"한동안 혈압을 확인하지 않았다면 혈압을 재고, 집에 체온계를 마련해 체온을 확인하라.\",\"condition\":{\"operator\":\"ALL\",\"clauses\":[\"한동안 혈압을 확인하지 않았다면\",\"집에 체온계를 마련해서 체온이 괜찮은지 확인할 수 있게 하라\"]},\"medicationRole\":\"NONE\",\"alternativeGroup\":null,\"actionStatus\":\"FUTURE\",\"medication\":null,\"task\":{\"kind\":\"OTHER\",\"title\":\"혈압 재기 및 체온 확인\",\"date\":null,\"time\":null,\"recurrence\":\"ONCE\",\"lastDate\":null,\"weekdays\":[]},\"uncertaintyCodes\":[]}],\"summaryFactIds\":[\"f1\",\"f8\",\"f9\",\"f10\"]}"
